  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n (X-5Y)/(X+5Y)=(7)/(13)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (X-5Y)/(X+5Y)=(7)/(13)\n\n⇒ 13 × (X - 5Y) = 7 × (X + 5Y)\n\n⇒ 13 X - 65 Y = 7 X + 35 Y\n\n⇒ 13 X - 7 X = 65 Y + 35 Y\n\n⇒ 6 X = 100 Y\n\n⇒ X/Y = 100/6 = 50/3\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 50/3.**",
